# The first steps of a new mage, by mouse and keyboard, through the real
# client (`dyno drive`, see docs/design/ui.md). Run by tools/drive/run.sh on
# a fresh world whose operator is this character. Every `expect` is a state
# the step before must have caused.

# --- 1. arrive: a tip shows; walk to the quest giver; talk; accept ---------
expect tip move
walk-to npc brannoc 3
look-at npc brannoc
click right npc brannoc
expect panel dialog
expect tip-clear
click left at dialog.quest.cold_hearth
click left at dialog.accept
expect quest cold_hearth
shot 1-accepted
key Escape
expect panel none

# --- 2. a creature: select it with the mouse; a key; a click on the bar ----
# (creatures are summoned in front of the character: face open ground first)
turn 180
say /summon grazer
wait 1.5
look-at creature grazer
click left creature grazer
expect target creature
key 2
expect debuff
shot 2-debuff
expect not casting
key 1
expect casting
expect not casting
say /summon grazer
wait 1.5
look-at creature grazer
click left creature grazer
expect target creature
click left at bar.0
expect casting
shot 2-casting
expect not casting

# --- 3. loot a body ----------------------------------------------------------
# (every grazer near falls, so none stands between the pointer and a body)
until loot open
  say /summon grazer
  wait 1.2
  say /slay
  wait 0.6
  say /slay
  wait 0.6
  say /slay
  wait 1.2
  look-at corpse grazer
  click right corpse grazer
  wait 1
end
shot 3-loot
click left at loot.all
expect loot closed

# --- 4. bags: open with the key, equip with a right-click -------------------
say /give acolytes_hood 1
expect pack acolytes_hood
key B
expect tab bags
expect tip-clear
click right at bagitem.acolytes_hood
expect equipped acolytes_hood
shot 4-equipped

# --- 5. spellbook: drag an ability to the bar; point at it for its tooltip --
click left at tab.Spellbook
expect tab spellbook
press at spell.fireball
move at bar.4
shot 5-dragging
release
expect bar 4 fireball
expect bar 0 empty
hover at bar.4
expect mark tooltip.ability
shot 5-tooltip

# --- 6. a tip: click it away -------------------------------------------------
expect mark tip
click left at tip
expect not mark tip

# --- 7. a window: drag it by its header --------------------------------------
remember window.screens
drag at header.screens by 180 70
expect moved window.screens

# --- 7b. the map: M opens it, Esc closes it -----------------------------------
key M
expect map open
expect mark map.canvas
shot 7-map
key Escape
expect map closed

# --- 8. with the window open and a tip on screen, the world still takes clicks
walk-to npc brannoc 3
look-at npc brannoc
click left npc brannoc
expect target npc
key P
expect tab spellbook
expect mark tip
turn 180
say /summon grazer
wait 1.5
look-at creature grazer
click left creature grazer
expect target creature
click right creature grazer
expect attacking
shot 8-world-click

# --- 9. a level: the banner, and the new ability on the first free key --------
until level 2
  say /summon grazer
  wait 1.0
  say /slay
  wait 0.6
  say /summon grazer
  wait 1.0
  say /slay
  wait 0.6
  say /summon grazer
  wait 1.0
  say /slay
  wait 0.6
end
expect banner
shot 9-level-up
expect bar 0 fire_blast
